    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you hit a creature with a melee weapon attack, you can spend 2 rage points to attempt a deep wound. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or lose 1d4 hit points due to blood loss. The deep wound lasts for 1 minute.</p><p>At the end of its turn, the target loses another 1d4 hit points. It then makes another Constitution saving throw, ending the bleeding on a successful save.</p>",
